"text": "Watson and Crick got there only thanks to Rosalind Franklin", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-29T20:32:27Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "oh was about to type that", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-29T20:32:44Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "she worked in London and produced the images that helped Watson and Crick get there", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-29T20:32:47Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "they didn’t credit her", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-29T20:33:04Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "otherwise Pauling would have gotten there first — even in their own estimation", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-29T20:33:22Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "The Double Helix by James Watson gives his perspective on the race", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-29T20:33:28Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "worth reading", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-29T20:53:24Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "the best book about the subject is The Secret of Life: well-written, covers contributions from all, conveys the sense of the race", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-29T20:53:38Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "by Howard Markel", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]